# Portfolio site — no secrets required for the public static build.
# Copy to .env only if you add server-side features later (analytics, forms API, etc.).
#
# NUXT_PUBLIC_* variables are exposed to the browser — never put passwords or API secrets there.
#
# Hosting base path (must match where the site is served):
# NUXT_APP_BASE_URL=/                    ← Vercel, custom domain at root
# NUXT_APP_BASE_URL=/Kyle-Portfolio/     ← GitHub Pages project site
#
# Example (future use only):
# NUXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.com
